    <guid isPermaLink="false">673f04d011045e78e5d3bbad</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Nov 2024 10:24:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🕙这一期中，你将听到——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 中产三件宝，安踏占两个？你知道FILA、科隆、迪桑特、始祖鸟都是安踏的品牌吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="479">07:59</a> 5亿对价，数十倍回报：安踏获得FILA中国运营权始末</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 借助成功运营FILA经验，顺势将迪桑特和科隆中国纳入囊中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 层层杠杆，豪掷56亿欧元收购亚玛芬，收获始祖鸟与萨洛蒙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 复制FILA奇迹，始祖鸟中国业绩突飞猛进：安踏做对了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> 同为国货之光，李宁近年来做了什么？做得如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2943">49:03</a> 安踏收购国内新消费品牌MAIA，对一级市场有什么启示吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3144">52:24</a> 李宁与红杉成立合资公司拓展海外市场，双方打的什么算盘？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3299">54:59</a> 下一步，强力产品矩阵支撑下的安踏如何向国际市场发起冲锋？</span></p>]]></description>
